%%% note
プロパティ: configuration-properties (YAML の入れ子と配列、.properties の ${} 参照と前後の
空白)、global-property、同じキーを configuration-properties と global-property で定義した
ときの優先順位、p() と属性値の ${}、DW の文字列の中の ${}、存在しないキーの p()。
listener-config の basePath と attributes.listenerPath / relativePath。
%%% port 18126
%%% request GET /base/props
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "yamlText": "hello from yaml",
  "yamlDeep": "deep value",
  "yamlList": "first,second",
  "propsPlain": "from properties file",
  "propsRef": "ref to hello from yaml",
  "propsSpaces": "[spaced value ]",
  "globalProp": "global property value",
  "missing": null,
  "port": "18126"
}
%%% request GET /base/placeholder
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "a": "hello from yaml",
  "b": "prefix-global property value-suffix",
  "c": "deep value!"
}
%%% request GET /base/info/x/y
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "listenerPath": "/base/info/*",
  "requestPath": "/base/info/x/y",
  "relativePath": "/info/x/y"
}
%%% request GET /props
%%% response 404
content-type: text/plain

No listener for endpoint: /props
%%% request GET /base/jvm
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "tzSet": true,
  "sep": "/"
}
